l figure, known as a key architect of the administration's hardline immigration policies.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ueno Bank scandal plunges Paraguay into political crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:be7e93cd526d837185bdae6c8a5fdecf9890fe99a0ab30f4f703e01ce59e223b</id><updated>2026-11-06T21:39:22Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T20:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ueno-bank-scandal-plunges-paraguay-into-political-crisis/a-79881388--35a7e5f2572b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ueno-bank-scandal-plunges-paraguay-into-political-crisis/a-79881388?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Suspected financial fraud, public money at risk and millions of customers affected: Paraguay is in serious crisis following the sudden collapse of Ueno Bank. President Santiago Pena is facing impeachment.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Critics say Democrats should look into Trump's Middle East deals in future corruption investigations</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:52de94fd6b3f826221ceafaf7dc2bb06ca0453e7439a0586c496d683479ed34e</id><updated>2026-11-06T21:39:25Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T19:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/critics-say-democrats-should-look-into-trump-s-middle-east-deals-in-future-corruption-investigations/a-79877104--54038fc6b2c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/critics-say-democrats-should-look-into-trump-s-middle-east-deals-in-future-corruption-investigations/a-79877104?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After their victory in the US midterm elections, the Democrats have promised to investigate corruption in the Trump administration. Critics say the president's Middle East deals is an area they should focus on.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ilse Aigner tipped by party allies as next German preside