ithout Russia.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Global temperatures are set to exceed 1.5 degrees above pre-industrial levels in 2026, likely the second-warmest year on record</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:294c8e74cd65801e548bff56226523fe151dfbf8c1fecd3129b984223efe6aa0</id><updated>2026-11-06T21:38:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T13:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/global-temperatures-are-set-to-exceed-1-5-degrees-above-pre-industrial-levels-in-2026-likely-the-sec/a-79874098--d560bb827fee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/global-temperatures-are-set-to-exceed-1-5-degrees-above-pre-industrial-levels-in-2026-likely-the-second-warmest-year-on-record/a-79874098?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Climate scientists say the world is set to breach the critical 1.5-degree Celsius threshold in 2026. This year is also on track to become the second-warmest on record.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>For people in Iran, a constant threat of war and dearth of information</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2a2031687bd96dc30a97fbb0365e3502135be5aad506c142169ffefd2ae5b178</id><updated>2026-11-06T21:38:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T12:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/for-people-in-iran-a-constant-threat-of-war-and-dearth-of-information/a-79875438--15c623b3dc73.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/for-people-in-iran-a-constant-threat-of-war-and-dearth-of-information/a-79875438?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Most people in Iran have little idea of the course of the US-led war and peace talks on the global stage. With few sources of information, the population must navigate conflicting rumors and fears of a nuclear attack.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>New bomb threats target Irish media, more European flights</title><i